  "metaDescription": "Bareskrim Polri questioned Budi Arie for nine hours regarding an alleged treason case. Meanwhile, the former aide to Jokowi faces a rescheduled summons.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Bareskrim Polri interrogated Budi Arie for nine hours, posing 42 questions regarding an ongoing treason investigation.",
